      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HELLO CINDY LOU (1) held her own to the line last start and filled a minor placing, beaten only 2 lengths (29.95) behind Great Chat at Northam. Solid formlines coming through her last run. Capable of going well again. SUNSET GODDESS (8) was an on-speed winner in the quickest time of the program two back then gave a start but got home into the frame when third at this track (22.76) last time. Yet to score from this box but has never missed the frame in two starts. Hard to beat again. BOLT OF FUN (4) has been in super consistent form, finishing in the minors at her last four runs. Last start finished 3rd over 400m at this track beaten 5.5 lengths (22.77) behind Farmer Russell in a Free For All on September 25. The form from her last run stacks up well. Bold showing expected. RIGATONI MONELLI (6) has ability and finds the right scenario to bounce back.",
